ype="Paragraph3"><b>Softshell Jackets:</b> Combining style with functionality, <a href="https://venustasofficial.com/products/men-s-soft-shell-heated-jacket-7-4v?_pos=1&amp;_sid=ad9bbde88&amp;_ss=r" target="_self">Venustas Men’s Soft Shell Heated Jacket 7.4V</a> is both wind and water-resistant, offering versatility for various outdoor conditions. It is typically made with a flexible, breathable outer layer, providing comfort and protection against the elements.</p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/E674A6F3-DA7D-4468-A540-7FE28A7DF945_500x.png?v=1710394723" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/E674A6F3-DA7D-4468-A540-7FE28A7DF945.png?v=1710394723 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/E674A6F3-DA7D-4468-A540-7FE28A7DF945_500x.png?v=1710394723 320w" width="788" height="1024" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="E674A6F3-DA7D-4468-A540-7FE28A7DF945.png__PID:8ef77723-f941-49ef-a04b-af97fd6c8ee7" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fbyfCU cCdixN pf-41_"/><p class="sc-hOGkXu hVdrsp pf-42_" tabindex="0" spellcheck="false" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Waterproof Jackets: </b>For those who venture into wet or snowy conditions, Venustas offers waterproof heated jackets. These jackets feature a waterproof outer layer to keep you dry, combined with the brand's signature heating technology to ensure warmth even in damp environments.</p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/IMG_8239_41e37671-1795-4aad-8822-2aef67055b4c_500x.jpg?v=1710387420" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/IMG_8239_41e37671-1795-4aad-8822-2aef67055b4c.jpg?v=1710387420 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/files/IMG_8239_41e37671-1795-4aad-8822-2aef67055b4c_500x.jpg?v=1710387420 320w" width="2500" height="1667" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-